            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 visible friendly non-**^^Unique Hedonites of Slaanesh War Machines^^** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the targets&apos; melee weapons for the rest of the turn. This ability also affects **Companion** weapons.</characteristic>
