            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Shooting Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit in combat to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, this unit&apos;s ranged weapons have **Shoot in Combat** and they also have **Crit (Auto-wound)** for attacks that target that enemy unit.</characteristic>
