          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Phase (Army), Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Move^^** ability for a unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this **^^Manifestation^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If that enemy unit does not end the move closer to this **^^Manifestation^^** than it was at the start of the move, inflict D6 mortal damage on it after the **^^Move^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic>
