            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this **^^Manifestation^^** to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Until this **^^Manifestation^^** is banished or destroyed, the target is **tongue-tied** while it is within 12&quot; of this **^^Manifestation^^**. While the target is **tongue-tied**:


• It cannot use **^^Run^^** abilities.
• Your opponent must roll a D6 instead of a D3 when determining the amount of mortal damage inflicted on the target when it uses a **^^Retreat^^** ability.</characteristic>
