            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this terrain feature to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, until the start of your next turn while the target is within x&quot; of this terrain feature, the target&apos;s weapons have the **Companion** weapon ability, where X is determined by the current battle round as follows:


**Battle Round 1:** 9&quot;
**Battle Round 2:** 12&quot;
**Battle Round 3:** 15&quot;
**Battle Round 4:** 18&quot;
**Battle Round 5:** 21&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Fane of Slaanesh" id="6f47-50f1-1e37-8e67" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit">
