            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit has not used a **^^Temptation^^** ability this turn, pick a visible friendly **^^Sybarite^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the target is a **^^Paragon^^**, apply the following effect to the target. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, apply the following effect to the target:
• For the rest of the turn, while the target is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target&apos;s melee weapons.</characteristic>
