                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">**Heal (X)** this unit, where **X** is the number of damage points allocated to this unit. For the rest of the turn, add 1 to hit rolls and wound rolls for this unit&apos;s attacks, and add 1 to save rolls for this unit. At the start of the next turn, this unit is automatically destroyed.</characteristic>
